<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-DEPORTIVO CLOSE ON LEADERS BARCELONA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DEPORTIVO CLOSE ON LEADERS BARCELONA.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deportivo Coruna made up ground on the leaders in the Spanish first division on Sunday with a 4-1 win over struggling Logrones.</p>
<p>Deportivo moved one point behind table-topping Barcelona, 2-1 losers at Athletic Bilbao on Saturday. Real Madrid need to win their evening game against Valencia to go into first place.</p>
